@* Isti obrazac za dodavanje i uređivanje korisnika; pri uređivanju prazna lozinka znači "ne mijenjaj". *@
@model KorisnikFormViewModel
@{
    var novi = Model.Id is null;
    ViewData["Title"] = novi ? "Novi korisnik" : "Uređivanje korisnika";
}

<nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
    <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a asp-action="Index">Korisnici</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">@(novi ? "Dodavanje" : "Uređivanje")</li>
    </ol>
</nav>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h1 class="h4 mb-3">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

                <form method="post" novalidate autocomplete="off">
                    <input asp-for="Id" type="hidden" />
                    <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="alert alert-danger"></div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label asp-for="Email" class="form-label"></label>
                        <input asp-for="Email" type="email" class="form-control" autocomplete="off" autofocus />
                        <span asp-validation-for="Email" class="text-danger"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label asp-for="ImePrezime" class="form-label"></label>
                        <input asp-for="ImePrezime" class="form-control" />
                        <span asp-validation-for="ImePrezime" class="text-danger"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label asp-for="Uloga" class="form-label"></label>
                        @* Vlastitu ulogu nije moguće mijenjati: polje je onemogućeno, a vrijednost se šalje skrivenim poljem. *@
                        <select asp-for="Uloga" asp-items="Model.Uloge" class="form-select" disabled="@Model.JeTrenutni"></select>
                        @if (Model.JeTrenutni)
                        {
                            <input type="hidden" name="@nameof(Model.Uloga)" value="@Model.Uloga" />
                            <div class="form-text">Ne možete promijeniti vlastitu ulogu.</div>
                        }
                        <span asp-validation-for="Uloga" class="text-danger"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label asp-for="Lozinka" class="form-label"></label>
                        <input asp-for="Lozinka" class="form-control" autocomplete="new-password" />
                        <div class="form-text">
                            @(novi ? "Najmanje 6 znakova, uz veliko i malo slovo, znamenku i poseban znak." : "Ostavite prazno ako ne mijenjate lozinku.")
                        </div>
                        <span asp-validation-for="Lozinka" class="text-danger"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label asp-for="PotvrdaLozinke" class="form-label"></label>
                        <input asp-for="PotvrdaLozinke" class="form-control" autocomplete="new-password" />
                        <span asp-validation-for="PotvrdaLozinke" class="text-danger"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Spremi</button>
                        <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Odustani</a>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <partial name="_ValidationScriptsPartial" />
}
